'''Kory''' (コアラッキョ, ''Koarakkyo'', '''Koalakkyo''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

