==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Kory
|Marching Kory
|A Traitless enemy introduced in the [[Cats in Love#Sweetest Sorrow|Sweetest Sorrow]] event. He has improved health, damage, speed and attack rate, but is the only variant to lack [[Wave Attack]]s.
