|A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] Kory variant from the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]. More durable and fires level 5 Wave Attacks, but has a slightly longer backswing and attack rate.
